{"name": "The Light that Binds Us", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>The Light that Binds Us\u00a0is a student-made game created in around 40 days by <strong>ISART Digital students</strong> as part of their <strong>final-year project</strong>, giving them the opportunity to put their skills and learning into practice. We hope you enjoy the experience they have created for you!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/adb6a4f6f891f172151e7e1d2c693db9.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"845\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/adb6a4f6f891f172151e7e1d2c693db9.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"186\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/0386bca6376a3bbad9e91da51cecc57a.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/0386bca6376a3bbad9e91da51cecc57a.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the ancient lands of Tang-era China, Yu\u00e8, the daughter of a local lord, perishes in the flames of political war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reunited in the afterlife with her faithful celestial guardian dog, Y\u00fan, she must embark on a funerary journey through the depths of Diyu, uncovering forgotten memories, overcoming spiritual trials, and confronting the destiny that was shaped for her long before her death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Light that Binds</i> Us is an atmospheric 3D puzzle-narrative adventure set within Diyu: the transitional underworld of Chinese mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/2ecbf1acd652e39bef017709cc5b72bd.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"845\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/2ecbf1acd652e39bef017709cc5b72bd.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/a7bb8d6f4b70e1e050f51dcf80814291.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"845\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/a7bb8d6f4b70e1e050f51dcf80814291.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"186\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/c9c982c8fd3dc1c1794916a6659a910c.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"166\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/c9c982c8fd3dc1c1794916a6659a910c.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Diyu is no ordinary underworld. It absorbs the lives of those who wander through it, forging a realm in their image. Joys, sorrows, memories and even the very circumstances of your death etched into its walls forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This world forgets <strong>nothing</strong>. Your only path through it is the mastery of light and shadow. <strong>Let the shadows guide you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Inspired by the ancient <strong>art of Chinese shadow puppetry</strong>, <i>The Light that Binds Us</i> reimagines what a puzzle game can feel like. Shadows here are not decorative: they are <strong>tangible, physical platforms</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/073f1bb4e99dabaf39837aad8637ead9.poster.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"710\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/073f1bb4e99dabaf39837aad8637ead9.webm?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/073f1bb4e99dabaf39837aad8637ead9.mp4?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By projecting light across the environment, you transform empty voids into solid paths you can walk, climb and build upon in real time. Every puzzle demands that you think in three dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To find each solution, you must carefully observe your surroundings and adjust four interconnected parameters: the position of your <strong>light source</strong>, its <strong>distance</strong> from the target, the <strong>projection angle</strong> and the <strong>structural shape of the object</strong> being cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"232\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/b38cbb92c7cfbac78df61a409ced1de0.poster.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/b38cbb92c7cfbac78df61a409ced1de0.webm?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/b38cbb92c7cfbac78df61a409ced1de0.mp4?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do not forget Y\u00fan, your <strong>faithful companion</strong> and <strong>living light source</strong>. Your collaboration is essential to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With him, find ways to activate ancient <strong>stone artifacts</strong>, ignite dormant light plinths and amplify receptacles to manipulate complex geometry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your bond with Y\u00fan and how well you work together dictate your progression through the world of Diyu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"262\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/44e34e037120bd4ab8a879a8c810334a.poster.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"708\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/44e34e037120bd4ab8a879a8c810334a.webm?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/44e34e037120bd4ab8a879a8c810334a.mp4?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"186\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/348a3f773ddf8d16d0158d8a1d3dc5a5.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/348a3f773ddf8d16d0158d8a1d3dc5a5.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/fd6b0f5f7ba2c758294af5f4b3b7fd35.poster.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"672\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/fd6b0f5f7ba2c758294af5f4b3b7fd35.webm?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/fd6b0f5f7ba2c758294af5f4b3b7fd35.mp4?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cast</strong> and <strong>reshape</strong> structural shadows to build <strong>physical platforms</strong> across dangerous chasms and vertical spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"186\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/88288bca712e3014e2e9a373c03f41e3.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/88288bca712e3014e2e9a373c03f41e3.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/832c7b5065b8ff180087c6a3d406dfb9.poster.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"672\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/832c7b5065b8ff180087c6a3d406dfb9.webm?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/832c7b5065b8ff180087c6a3d406dfb9.mp4?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Command <strong>Y\u00fan</strong> independently to solve multi-layered environmental puzzles requiring <strong>precise coordination</strong> between <strong>both characters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"186\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/939fd40a6bb911be81d212489953bcec.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/939fd40a6bb911be81d212489953bcec.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/488630f67b8acddae50971f7ca19e4d9.poster.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"672\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/488630f67b8acddae50971f7ca19e4d9.webm?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/488630f67b8acddae50971f7ca19e4d9.mp4?t=1784278197\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel through <strong>misty caves</strong>, vast mountain ranges, <strong>ancient temple</strong> complexes and <strong>dense forests</strong> inspired by real historical structures of the era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"186\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/ab2cb0f78a79ca3a830567ffad112eac.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/ab2cb0f78a79ca3a830567ffad112eac.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/f312f1ea805656d2a90e3a5c3b6e30ce.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"662\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/f312f1ea805656d2a90e3a5c3b6e30ce.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore monumental statues, hidden wall frescoes, and story-rich collectibles: including the <strong>Damaged Doll</strong>, <strong>Bloodstained Dao</strong> and <strong>Custom Tea Set</strong>, that slowly piece together the tragedy behind Yu\u00e8's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"186\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/7bb798b833ce007dc24c4a8875db1996.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras_big/c2f434aa7d9138a4b20b200a05653e58.webp?t=1784278197\" height=\"166\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/extras/c2f434aa7d9138a4b20b200a05653e58.avif?t=1784278197\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A fully dynamic score blending Western orchestral composition with live-recorded traditional Chinese instruments like the <strong>Erhu</strong> (Eliott Tordo), the <strong>Xiao flute</strong> (Josh Plotner), and the <strong>vocals</strong> of Aeralie Brighton, shifting seamlessly in real time to match your exploration and emotional journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow Yu\u00e8 and Y\u00fan on this journey through Diyu and see if you can help her unlock her memories.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dive into The Light That Binds Us, a puzzle-adventure game where light shapes reality. Play as Yu\u00e8, a tormented soul, accompanied by her faithful protector, Y\u00fan. Cast shadows into paths, reshape the world to solve puzzles, explore breathtaking environments, and uncover the past that binds you!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196170/38147f16360e169a97cdeaf041d339e36c21e9a1/header.jpg?t=1784278197", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Casual", "Platformer", "Puzzle", "3D Platformer", "Puzzle Platformer"], "developers": "ISART DIGITAL", "publishers": "ISART DIGITAL", "release_date": "Jun 23, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4196170", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 June 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/X73q0GMVokE", "first_seen": 1782172800.0, "review_rank": 360}